  "features": [
    "adds a top-level Reconcile environment for selective project-state reconciliation",
    "starts from deterministic Change Review output rather than an opaque merge engine",
    "requires explicit user selection of every change to carry forward",
    "supports current project and same-project restore-point target states",
    "validates key object, evidence, decision, traceability, Canvas, reproducibility, and briefing dependencies before creation",
    "blocks creation when selected changes would leave explicit dangling dependencies",
    "creates every reconciled result as a new local project copy with remapped local IDs",
    "preserves both source states without in-place mutation",
    "exports portable sc-workspace-reconciliation-plan/1.0 JSON",
    "stores only a browser-local reconciliation ledger at Workspace level",
    "advances storage schema 24 to 25 while keeping project schema sc-workspace-project/11.0 unchanged",
    "retains Change Gates, conflict-safe sync, restore points, account recovery, and canonical Knowledge Library routing"
  ],
